# Run examples:
#
# Test all CTS modules. A large request. Tests are broken down by module.
# Expect many module timeouts due to >1h runtime. These issues
# will be addressed with future development.
#
#   bazel test @goldfish_test//cts:cts
#
# Test a specific module.  Must complete in <1h (including emulator
# boot) to avoid a timeout:
#
#   bazel test @goldfish_test//cts:cts.CtsAdServicesPermissionsNoPermEndToEndTests

